    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "settings": {
        "caption": "Common questions",
        "heading": "Before you order",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "layout": "section",
        "container_color_scheme": "scheme-2",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "open_first_collapsible_row": true,
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "desktop_layout": "image_second",
        "padding_top": 52,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      },
      "blocks": {
        "faq-sizing": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I know which size to order?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "row_content": "<p>Order the size that matches your usual shoe size. If you are between sizes, or you wear a wide fit, size up. Every product page lists its size range, and our Sizing Guide walks you through measuring your foot in about a minute. Still unsure? Email us your shoe size and we will tell you which to pick.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will my order arrive?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders leave our warehouse within 1–2 business days. Standard US delivery usually takes 5–8 business days from there, and shipping is free on orders over $50. You will get a tracking link by email as soon as your parcel is on its way.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-returns": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if they don't work for me?",
            "icon": "return",
            "row_content": "<p>You have 60 days to decide. Wear them, walk in them, put them through a full work week. If they are not right, email us and we will send you a return label for a full refund. No photos, no phone calls, no restocking fee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-materials": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are they made of?",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Most of our insoles use a firm EVA foam base with a softer top layer and a breathable fabric cover. Compression socks are a nylon and spandex knit. Braces use a stretch fabric with an open-knit panel behind the joint. The exact materials for each item are listed on its product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-fit": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will these fit in my shoes?",
            "icon": "shoe",
            "row_content": "<p>Our insoles are made to sit in everyday sneakers, work boots and most closed shoes. They are trim-to-fit, so you can cut them down along the printed guide lines. They are a tight fit in dress shoes and flats with a shallow footbed — if that is what you wear most, choose one of our low-profile options.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["faq-sizing", "faq-shipping", "faq-returns", "faq-materials", "faq-fit"]
    },
